        "## Step 4. Check and download the results\n",
        "\n",
        "This cell shows the output checks and the first five rows of the main submission. Each row contains a batch, a sampling time, and four predicted measurements.\n",
        "\n",
        "In Google Colab, it also downloads the three submission CSV files. In local Jupyter, it shows links to those files. The run log and experiment report are available in `outputs`.\n"
